/* ---------- statistics count-up ----------
   Plays once per page visit, the first time the statistics row scrolls into view. Final value, prefix/suffix, digit script (Persian/Arabic/Latin),
   thousand separators and decimals are all read from the rendered text, so edited values keep working. No animation while editing, when the
   site's animations switch is off / prefers-reduced-motion is set, or without IntersectionObserver: the final values are simply shown. */
let statsPlayed = false, statsObs = null, statsRaf = 0;
